93
00:06:15,667 --> 00:06:17,374
Let me try something.

94
00:06:17,374 --> 00:06:20,381
Mark the commits the wrong way round:

95
00:06:20,933 --> 00:06:26,290
Some good revs are not ancestors of the bad rev … Maybe you mistook good and bad revs?

96
